Close the SQLCipher stores opened by the final schema-dump tests.  Open file
descriptors do not by themselves keep the GHC runtime alive, so this is not the
primary shutdown fix, but leaving three connections open until process exit
makes the suite's final directory cleanup race unnecessary and hides genuine
store-lifetime mistakes.

Index: tests/AgentTests/SchemaDump.hs
--- tests/AgentTests/SchemaDump.hs.orig
+++ tests/AgentTests/SchemaDump.hs
